 {
  "key": "c0.4.0",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"inv-section chapter ch-arrival\" id=\"arrival\" data-chapter=\"0\" data-chapter-name=\"Arrival\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"arr-bg\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"inv-img-2\" id=\"arrBg\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f46a20fa8ba8dababd_care-1.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"eager\"><div class=\"arr-bg-after\"></div></div><div class=\"inv-div-2 wrap arr-in\"><div class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"inv-p chapter-tag\" data-anim=\"hide\"><i class=\"inv-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 00 \u00b7 Arrival</span></p><h1 class=\"inv-h1\" id=\"arrTitle\" data-anim=\"hide\">A straighter smile, <em class=\"inv-em\">without anyone noticing.</em></h1><p class=\"inv-p-2 lead\" id=\"arrLead\" data-anim=\"hide\"> All-inclusive Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> treatment with Dr. William Sung, DMD at Mason Park Dental of Katy. Clear, removable aligners planned in 3D \u2014 and right now, a thousand dollars less than our regular fee. </p><div class=\"price-block\" id=\"arrPrice\" data-anim=\"hide\"><div class=\"price-now\" data-count-to=\"3800\">$3,800</div><div class=\"price-meta\"><span class=\"price-save\">Save $1,000</span> <span class=\"mpd-box price-was\">Regular $4,800<div class=\"price-was-after\"></div></span></div><p class=\"inv-p-3 fine\"> Prepay in full and take a further <strong class=\"mpd-box\">$500 off</strong>. Insurance payments are reimbursed back to you. In-office and third-party payment plans available. </p></div><ul class=\"chips\" id=\"arrChips\" data-anim=\"hide\"><li class=\"chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick inv-emb-1 inv-emb-2 tick\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>Free consultation</li><li class=\"chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick inv-emb-1 inv-emb-2 tick\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>Free 3D &amp; wellness scan</li><li class=\"chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick inv-emb-1 inv-emb-2 tick\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>Free Vivera<sup>\u00ae</sup> retainers</li><li class=\"chip\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tick inv-emb-1 inv-emb-2 tick\" fill=\"none\" height=\"14\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\"><path d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path></svg>Free KOR<sup>\u00ae</sup> whitening gel</li></ul><div class=\"inv-div-3 rating\" data-anim=\"hide\"><span class=\"stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"inv-emb-1 inv-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"inv-emb-1 inv-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"inv-emb-1 inv-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"inv-emb-1 inv-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg><svg class=\"inv-emb-1 inv-svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"16\"><path d=\"M10 1l2.6 5.3 5.9.9-4.2 4.1 1 5.8L10 14.4 4.7 17.1l1-5.8L1.5 7.2l5.9-.9z\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"score\">5.0</span> <span class=\"src\">rated by our patients on Google</span></div><div class=\"inv-div-4 arr-cue\" data-anim=\"hide\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Begin</span><i class=\"inv-i-3\"></i></div></div><div class=\"form-card\" id=\"book\" data-anim=\"hide\"><div class=\"form-head\"><p class=\"inv-p eyebrow\">Free consultation</p><h2 class=\"h2\">Start with a look, not a commitment</h2><p class=\"inv-p small muted\">Two quick steps. No cost, no obligation.</p></div><div data-embed-slot=\"0\"></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
