 {
  "key": "c0.4.1",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"inv-section-2 chapter ch-hesitation\" id=\"hesitation\" data-chapter=\"1\" data-chapter-name=\"The Hesitation\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"hes-pin\" id=\"hesPin\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap\"><p class=\"inv-p chapter-tag\"><i class=\"inv-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 01 \u00b7 The Hesitation</span></p><p class=\"hes-statement\" id=\"hesStatement\"> A crooked bite is not only a cosmetic matter. It wears enamel, complicates cleaning, and puts strain on the joint. </p><div class=\"hes-after\" id=\"hesAfter\"><p class=\"inv-p-4\">Which is why putting it off rarely stays a cosmetic decision. Crowded teeth are harder to clean, and that invites gum disease, plaque and decay.</p><p class=\"inv-p-4\">The question worth answering is not whether to straighten them. It is what it actually involves, what it actually costs, and whether you are a candidate at all \u2014 which takes one free appointment to find out.</p></div><div class=\"hes-meter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"inv-i-4\" id=\"hesMeter\"></i></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
  "key": "c0.4.2",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"inv-section-2 chapter ch-correction\" id=\"correction\" data-chapter=\"2\" data-chapter-name=\"What It Corrects\" data-theme=\"dark\"><div class=\"cor-pin\" id=\"corPin\"><div class=\"cor-head\"><p class=\"inv-p chapter-tag\"><i class=\"inv-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 02 \u00b7 What It Corrects</span></p><h2 class=\"inv-h2\">Six bite problems clear aligners are built for.</h2><p class=\"inv-p-5 lead\">These are the cases we treat most often. Keep scrolling to walk through them.</p></div><div class=\"cor-track\" id=\"corTrack\"><article class=\"cor-card\"><span class=\"inv-span-4 no\">01</span><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Crossbite</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">The upper and lower jaws are misaligned. This can be the reason for degradation of teeth, loss of bone and periodontal disease.</p></article><article class=\"cor-card\"><span class=\"inv-span-4 no\">02</span><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Gapped teeth</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">Gaps between the teeth may occur due to abnormal growth of jawbone, or a lack of surrounding teeth allowing them to shift into the created space.</p></article><article class=\"cor-card\"><span class=\"inv-span-4 no\">03</span><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Underbite</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">This may take place due to inadequate upper teeth or growth anomalies in the jaw, causing an inappropriate bite.</p></article><article class=\"cor-card\"><span class=\"inv-span-4 no\">04</span><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Overbite</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">The upper jaw sits well over the lower jaw. An overbite may cause wearing of teeth on the lower jaw, joint problems and gum problems.</p></article><article class=\"cor-card\"><span class=\"inv-span-4 no\">05</span><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Crowded teeth</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">Untreated crowding can become extremely crooked. Misaligned teeth are harder to clean, which invites gum disease, plaque and tooth decay.</p></article><article class=\"cor-card\"><span class=\"inv-span-4 no\">06</span><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Open bite</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">An open bite happens when the teeth in the upper and lower jaws do not meet properly.</p></article></div><div class=\"inv-div-5 cor-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"inv-i-4\" id=\"corBar\"></i></div><p class=\"cor-foot\"> For more complicated cases, fixed, lingual or clear braces may suit you better. Dr. Sung will tell you which at your consultation. </p></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
  "key": "c0.4.3",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"inv-section-2 chapter ch-inclusion\" id=\"inclusion\" data-chapter=\"3\" data-chapter-name=\"The Inclusion\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"inc-pin\" id=\"incPin\"><div class=\"inv-div-6 wrap inc-grid\"><div class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"inv-p chapter-tag\"><i class=\"inv-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 03 \u00b7 The Inclusion</span></p><h2 class=\"inv-h2-2\">Everything is in the price. That is the point.</h2><p class=\"inv-p-7 lead\"> Clear-aligner quotes have a habit of growing after you say yes. Ours does not. The fee covers the scan, the aligners, the visits and what you need afterwards to keep the result. </p><div class=\"inc-list\" id=\"incList\"><div class=\"inv-div-7 inc-item\"><span class=\"inv-span-5 inc-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"inv-emb-3 inv-svg-2\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"inv-emb-4\" d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"inv-strong\">Free virtual or in-office consultation</strong> \u2014 see whether you are a candidate before you spend anything.</span></div><div class=\"inv-div-7 inc-item\"><span class=\"inv-span-5 inc-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"inv-emb-3 inv-svg-2\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"inv-emb-4\" d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"inv-strong\">Free 3D and wellness scan</strong> \u2014 digital scanning replaces the messy impression tray.</span></div><div class=\"inv-div-7 inc-item\"><span class=\"inv-span-5 inc-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"inv-emb-3 inv-svg-2\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"inv-emb-4\" d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"inv-strong\">Free set of Vivera<sup>\u00ae</sup> retainers</strong> \u2014 teeth shift without retention, so retainers are included rather than sold to you at the end.</span></div><div class=\"inv-div-8 inc-item\"><span class=\"inv-span-5 inc-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"inv-emb-3 inv-svg-2\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path class=\"inv-emb-4\" d=\"M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"></path></svg></span> <span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"inv-strong\">Free KOR<sup>\u00ae</sup> teeth whitening gel</strong> \u2014 finish a straighter smile a few shades brighter.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><div class=\"ledger\"><p class=\"inv-p label\">All-inclusive fee</p><p class=\"ledger-figure\" id=\"incFigure\">$4,800</p><p class=\"ledger-state\" id=\"incState\">Regular fee</p><div class=\"ledger-rail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"inv-i-5\" id=\"incRail\"></i></div><div class=\"ledger-steps\" id=\"incSteps\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"inv-span-6 on\">Regular</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">$1,000 off</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">Prepaid</span></div><p class=\"inv-p-8 fine\"> A detailed treatment plan and cost breakdown are provided before treatment begins, so you will know your total before you commit to anything. </p></div><div class=\"inc-support\"><div class=\"tile\"><h3 class=\"inv-h3-2\">Insurance</h3><p class=\"inv-p-9\">Many plans include benefits that apply to Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup>, and our team can help verify your coverage. Where you have prepaid, insurance payments are reimbursed back to you.</p></div><div class=\"tile\"><img class=\"inv-img-3\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f46a20fa8ba8dabad3_cherry.svg\" alt=\"Cherry\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\" loading=\"lazy\"><h3 class=\"inv-h3-2\">Payment plans</h3><p class=\"inv-p-9\">In-office and third-party plans are available, including Cherry \u2014 0% APR with no hard credit check, so you can pay monthly.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
  "key": "c0.4.4",
  "parent": "c0.4",
  "html": "<section class=\"inv-section-2 chapter ch-provider\" id=\"provider\" data-chapter=\"4\" data-chapter-name=\"The Provider\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"inv-div-9 wrap chapter-body prov-grid\"><div class=\"prov-photo\"><div class=\"doc-photo\" id=\"provPlate\"><img class=\"inv-img-4\" id=\"provImg\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f59d16ef209fb2def2_dr-sung.webp\" alt=\"Dr. William Sung, DMD\" width=\"230\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"prov-sig\"><b class=\"inv-b-2\">Dr. William Sung</b><span class=\"inv-span-7\">DMD</span></div></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"inv-p chapter-tag\"><i class=\"inv-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 04 \u00b7 The Provider</span></p><h2 class=\"inv-h2-2\" id=\"provTitle\">Aligners are only as good as the plan behind them.</h2><p class=\"inv-p-7 lead\" id=\"provLead\"> For Dr. William Sung, dentistry is not just a job \u2014 it is a family business. Dr. Sung's father and two of his uncles are dentists. </p><p class=\"inv-p-10 muted\" id=\"provBio\"> Though there are many aspects of dentistry he enjoys, Dr. Sung's main motivation is helping others. Whether he is easing pain through a much-needed dental procedure or improving confidence with cosmetic dentistry, with every patient he treats he is reminded that he has achieved his lifelong dream of working in healthcare. </p><ul class=\"why-list\" id=\"provCreds\"><li class=\"inv-li\"><i class=\"inv-i-6\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Dental degree from Tufts University, Boston</span></li><li class=\"inv-li\"><i class=\"inv-i-6\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">10+ years of dental experience</span></li><li class=\"inv-li\"><i class=\"inv-i-6\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Fellowship in the Academy of General Dentistry \u2014 top 7% in Texas</span></li><li class=\"inv-li-2\"><i class=\"inv-i-6\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">100+ hours of continuing education every year</span></li></ul><div class=\"prov-why\"><p class=\"inv-p label\">Why treat here</p><ul class=\"why-list\" id=\"provWhy\"><li class=\"inv-li\"><i class=\"inv-i-6\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"inv-strong\">Personalised treatment plans.</strong> No two smiles are alike. Aligners are custom-designed to your dental structure for alignment, comfort and effectiveness throughout.</span></li><li class=\"inv-li\"><i class=\"inv-i-6\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"inv-strong\">Advanced digital scanning.</strong> 3D imaging maps your teeth precisely, so the plan is accurate \u2014 and you get a preview of your future smile before you begin.</span></li><li class=\"inv-li\"><i class=\"inv-i-6\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"inv-strong\">Convenient and comfortable.</strong> Virtually invisible and fully removable. Eat what you like, and brush and floss exactly as you always have.</span></li><li class=\"inv-li-2\"><i class=\"inv-i-6\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\"><strong class=\"inv-strong\">Fewer visits than braces.</strong> Traditional braces need frequent adjustments. With Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> you change aligners at home and come in less often.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"inv-div-3 btn-row\"><a class=\"inv-a-4 btn magnetic\" href=\"#book\"><div class=\"btn-before\"></div><span class=\"inv-span-3\">Book with Dr. Sung</span></a> <a class=\"inv-a-4 btn btn--ghost\" href=\"tel:+12817698878\" data-phone=\"href\"><div class=\"btn-before\"></div> Call <span class=\"inv-span-3\" data-phone-text=\"\">(281) 769-8878</span></a></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
 {
