  "html": "<section class=\"inv-section-2 chapter ch-invitation\" id=\"invitation\" data-chapter=\"6\" data-chapter-name=\"The Invitation\" data-theme=\"light\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap chapter-body\"><div class=\"mpd-box head-block head-block--center\"><p class=\"inv-p-11 chapter-tag\"><i class=\"inv-i-2\"></i><span class=\"mpd-box\">Chapter 06 \u00b7 The Invitation</span></p><h2 class=\"inv-h2-2\">Skip the trip. Start from your phone.</h2><p class=\"inv-p-13 lead\">Three steps, no time off work, and a real answer from the doctor.</p></div><div class=\"inv-div-11 steps inv-steps\" id=\"invSteps\"><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-before\"></div><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Snap some photos of your smile</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">A few clear pictures are enough for us to see what we are working with.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-before\"></div><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Write a quick message</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">Tell us what bothers you about your smile and what you would like to change.</p></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-before\"></div><h3 class=\"inv-h3\">Get a video response from the doctor</h3><p class=\"inv-p-6\">Not a form letter \u2014 a recorded answer about your case and your options.</p></div></div><div class=\"inv-div-12 inv-faq inv-faq-grid\"><div class=\"inv-faq-head\"><p class=\"inv-p eyebrow\">Before you book</p><h2 class=\"inv-h2-3\">The questions we are asked most.</h2></div><div class=\"faq\" id=\"invFaq\"><details class=\"inv-details\"><summary class=\"inv-summary\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">How long does Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> treatment take?</span><div class=\"summary-after\"></div></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"inv-p-14\">Treatment length varies based on individual needs. Some patients see results in a few months, while others require longer treatment.</p></div></details><details class=\"inv-details\"><summary class=\"inv-summary\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Is Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> painful?</span><div class=\"summary-after\"></div></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"inv-p-14\">Some mild pressure may occur when switching aligners, but discomfort is temporary and minimal.</p></div></details><details class=\"inv-details\"><summary class=\"inv-summary\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Who is a good candidate?</span><div class=\"summary-after\"></div></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"inv-p-14\">Teens and adults with mild to moderate spacing, crowding, or bite concerns are typically good candidates.</p></div></details><details class=\"inv-details\"><summary class=\"inv-summary\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Can I eat and drink with Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup>?</span><div class=\"summary-after\"></div></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"inv-p-14\">Aligners should be removed before eating or drinking anything other than water, allowing you to enjoy your favorite foods.</p></div></details><details class=\"inv-details\"><summary class=\"inv-summary\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Does dental insurance cover Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup>?</span><div class=\"summary-after\"></div></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"inv-p-14\">Many dental insurance plans include benefits that apply to Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> treatment. Our team can help verify your coverage.</p></div></details><details class=\"inv-details\"><summary class=\"inv-summary\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Are payment plans available?</span><div class=\"summary-after\"></div></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"inv-p-14\">Yes. We offer flexible financing options to help make Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> treatment accessible.</p></div></details><details class=\"inv-details\"><summary class=\"inv-summary\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Will I know my treatment cost before starting?</span><div class=\"summary-after\"></div></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"inv-p-14\">Yes. A detailed treatment plan and cost breakdown are provided before treatment begins.</p></div></details><details class=\"inv-details-2\"><summary class=\"inv-summary\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Will I need a retainer afterwards?</span><div class=\"summary-after\"></div></summary><div class=\"answer\"><p class=\"inv-p-14\">Yes. Retainers are essential to maintain your results and prevent teeth from shifting. A set of Vivera<sup>\u00ae</sup> retainers is included in your treatment.</p></div></details></div></div><div class=\"inv-close\" id=\"invClose\"><div class=\"mpd-box\"><p class=\"inv-p-15 eyebrow\">Limited-time Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> offer</p><h2 class=\"inv-h2-4\" id=\"invCloseTitle\">$1,000 off, and $500 more if you prepay.</h2><p class=\"inv-p-16\">The consultation costs nothing and tells you exactly where you stand \u2014 including whether clear aligners are the right treatment for your bite at all.</p></div><div class=\"mpd-box btn-row\"><a class=\"inv-a-5 btn btn--lg magnetic\" href=\"#book\"><div class=\"btn-before\"></div><span class=\"inv-span-3\">Book free consult</span></a> <a class=\"inv-a-6 btn btn--ghost btn--lg\" href=\"tel:+12817698878\" data-phone=\"href\"><div class=\"btn-before\"></div> Call <span class=\"inv-span-3\" data-phone-text=\"\">(281) 769-8878</span></a></div></div></div></section>",
  "split": false
 },
