  "html": "<footer class=\"site-foot\"><div class=\"mpd-box wrap\"><div class=\"foot-grid\"><div class=\"mpd-box\"><div class=\"inv-div-13 brand\"><img class=\"inv-img-6\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a60bdc0340e5f1784b4d553/6a75f6f55de88305f0932586_logo.webp\" alt=\"Mason Park Dental of Katy\" width=\"180\" height=\"69\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><p class=\"inv-p small\">We are located at the corner of Mason Rd and Kingsland Blvd, behind the Ranch 99 complex.</p></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"inv-h3-3\">Visit</h3><p class=\"inv-p\">21830 Kingsland Blvd #104A<span class=\"br-line\">Katy, TX 77450</span></p><p class=\"inv-p-17\"><a class=\"inv-a-7\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/21830+Kingsland+Blvd+%23104a,+Katy,+TX+77450/@29.775949,-95.7512199,17z\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get directions</a></p></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"inv-h3-3\">Call</h3><p class=\"inv-p\"><a class=\"inv-a-8\" href=\"tel:+12817698878\" data-phone=\"href\"><span class=\"mpd-box\" data-phone-text=\"\">(281) 769-8878</span></a></p><p class=\"inv-p-17 small\"><a class=\"inv-a-7\" href=\"https://www.flexbook.me/masonpark/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Schedule online</a></p></div><div class=\"mpd-box\"><h3 class=\"inv-h3-3\">Hours</h3><ul class=\"inv-ul hours-list small\"><li class=\"inv-li-3\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Monday</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">9am \u2013 6pm</span></li><li class=\"inv-li-3\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Tuesday</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">8am \u2013 5pm</span></li><li class=\"inv-li-3\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Wednesday</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">9am \u2013 6pm</span></li><li class=\"inv-li-3\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Thursday</span><span class=\"mpd-box\">8am \u2013 5pm</span></li><li class=\"inv-li-3\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">Fri \u2013 Sun</span><span class=\"inv-span-8\">Closed</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"foot-base\"><span class=\"mpd-box\">\u00a9 2026 Mason Park Dental of Katy. All rights reserved.</span> <span class=\"mpd-box\">Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> and Vivera<sup>\u00ae</sup> are registered trademarks of Align Technology, Inc. KOR<sup>\u00ae</sup> is a registered trademark of Evolve Dental Technologies, Inc.</span></div><p class=\"inv-p-8 fine\"> Offer terms: $1,000 off applies to all-inclusive Invisalign<sup>\u00ae</sup> treatment, reducing the regular $4,800 fee to $3,800. An additional $500 discount applies when treatment is prepaid in full, out of pocket. Where treatment has been prepaid, insurance payments are reimbursed back to the patient. In-office and third-party payment plans are available. Individual treatment needs are determined at consultation; not all patients are candidates for clear aligners. </p></div></footer>",
